%%{init: {'theme':'dark','themeVariables':{'fontSize':'14px','actorTextColor':'#E0E7FF','actorBkg':'#4338CA','actorBorder':'#6366F1','activationBorderColor':'#6366F1','signalColor':'#CBD5E1','signalTextColor':'#E2E8F0','noteBkgColor':'#1E293B','noteBorderColor':'#6366F1','noteTextColor':'#E2E8F0'},'sequence':{'mirrorActors':false,'messageFontSize':13,'actorFontSize':14,'noteMargin':10,'messageMargin':35,'width':200}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U  as Operador (Browser)
    participant FE as Frontend · React
    participant CF as CorrelationIdFilter
    participant RL as RateLimitFilter
    participant CS as ChangeController
    participant SV as CreateChangeService
    participant DM as Change (Domain)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant KA as KafkaEventPublisherAdapter
    participant K  as Apache Kafka

    U->>FE: Preenche formulário e submete
    FE->>FE: Validação client-side (HTML5 + JS)

    FE->>CF: POST /api/v1/changes
    CF->>CF: Lê X-Correlation-Id ou gera UUID
    CF->>CF: MDC.put(correlation_id, service)
    CF->>RL: Repassa request

    RL->>RL: Bucket4j: 100 req/min por IP
    alt Rate limit excedido
        RL-->>FE: 429 Too Many Requests (Retry-After: 60)
    end

    RL->>CS: Request com MDC propagado
    CS->>CS: @Valid — Bean Validation

    alt Validação falha (title, componentId, scheduledAt)
        CS-->>FE: 400 Bad Request (ProblemDetail RFC 7807)
        FE-->>U: Exibe erros por campo
    end

    CS->>SV: execute(CreateChangeCommand)
    Note over SV: @Transactional

    SV->>DM: Change.create(title, componentId, requestedBy, scheduledAt)
    Note over DM: changeId = UUID.randomUUID()<br/>correlationId = UUID.randomUUID()<br/>status = PREPARED<br/>domainEvents.add(ChangePreparedEvent)

    DM-->>SV: Change entity com event registrado

    SV->>DB: INSERT INTO changes (changeId, status=PREPARED, ...)
    DB-->>SV: ✓ persistido

    SV->>DM: saved.pullDomainEvents()
    DM-->>SV: [ChangePreparedEvent]

    SV->>KA: publish(ChangePreparedEvent)
    KA->>KA: wrap → IntegrationEvent{eventType:"ChangePreparedEvent", version:"1.0", correlationId, payload}
    KA->>K: kafkaTemplate.send("changeops.change.prepared", changeId, integrationEvent)
    K-->>KA: ACK (acks=all, timeout 10s)
    KA-->>SV: ✓ publicado

    SV->>DB: INSERT INTO change_events (changeId, PREPARED, correlationId)
    DB-->>SV: ✓ timeline registrada

    SV->>SV: changesCreatedCounter.increment()
    SV-->>CS: CreateChangeResult{changeId, status, correlationId}

    CS-->>FE: 201 Created<br/>Location: /api/v1/changes/{changeId}<br/>{changeId, status:"PREPARED", correlationId}

    FE->>FE: Fecha formulário, exibe confirmação
    FE-->>U: Mudança listada com status PREPARED

    loop Polling a cada 5s (usePolling hook)
        FE->>CS: GET /api/v1/changes?page=0&size=20
        CS-->>FE: Lista atualizada com status corrente
    end
